1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,060
One breezy morning, Pooh laid out a picnic:
a cloth, a pot of honey,

2
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:13,280
and a space just the size of a Piglet!

3
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,800
“For me?” asked Piglet.

4
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,020
“For us,” said Pooh.

5
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:23,210
But the wind, it seemed,
wanted to come too.

6
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:30,310
So off they went, over the heather
and under the pines,

7
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:33,370
with the bees close behind,
just in case.

8
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:38,970
“Perhaps…” said Pooh,
“it knows somewhere nicer.”

9
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,630
It did.

10
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:50,350
It wasn’t quite the picnic Pooh had planned.

11
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:55,460
But with Piglet beside him,
it was a perfectly wonderful afternoon.

